        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Gamston, Nottingham, Nottinghamshire, Derbyshire, Lincolnshire, Leicestershire, Rushcliffe, West Bridgford\n- Systems: NG postcode area, Nottingham postcode area, postcode districts, NG2\n\nFacts:\n- Gamston, Rushcliffe, is situated about 3 miles south-east of Nottingham.\n- Gamston, Rushcliffe, is part of the West Bridgford postcode of NG2.\n- The NG postcode area is also known as the Nottingham postcode area.\n- The NG postcode area is a group of postcode districts around Nottingham.\n- The NG postcode area covers Nottinghamshire except for the Bassetlaw district and the far southwest of Rushcliffe borough.\n- The NG postcode area also covers south east Derbyshire, south west Lincolnshire, and part of north east Leicestershire.",
